 now uses projector-specific bounds: non-Granite projectors continue to allow values in [0, n_layer], while Granite4 Vision is restricted to [0, n_layer - 1] because it indexes layer_outs directly.\r\n\r\nNegative values are now rejected, preventing unset markers from reaching runtime indexing. Validation errors also include the metadata key and the accepted range. Unit tests cover the boundary behavior for both MiniCPMV and Granite4 Vision.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\nI have read and agree with the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\nAI usage disclosure: yes, provided by https://github.com/ggml-org/security-scan-prompt","labels":[{"id":5322060471,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJH_K4M8AAAABPTgytw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/labels/testing","name":"testing","description":"Everything test related","color":"ADC44A","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9738498236,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJH_K4M8AAAACRHWwvA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/labels/mtmd","name":"mtmd","description":"Related to multimodal functionality (video/image/audio)","color":"29cdcc","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-24T08:16:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b1a354b1c204b3fd18b99d5afc79b66318710274","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ggerganov","id":1991296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTEyOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1991296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggerganov","html_url":"https://github.com/ggerganov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggerganov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggerganov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggerganov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gger